%% Business flow — ImportRecord.status lifecycle
%% Only states actually assigned in code are wired below.
%% ImportStatus also declares PROCESSING and CANCELLED, but nothing in
%% lambdas/* or shared/* ever sets them today — no transition to/from them exists.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UPLOADED: Upload Lambda saves the record

    UPLOADED --> SPLITTING: Split Lambda starts (EventBridge-invoked)
    SPLITTING --> QUEUED: chunks produced, one SQS message each
    SPLITTING --> FAILED: CSV produced zero chunks

    QUEUED --> RUNNING: first Worker processes a chunk

    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: Aggregator, all chunks in, failedRecords == 0
    RUNNING --> PARTIAL_SUCCESS: Aggregator, all chunks in, some rows failed validation
    RUNNING --> FAILED: Aggregator, all chunks in, every row failed validation

    COMPLETED --> [*]
    PARTIAL_SUCCESS --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]

    note right of RUNNING
        Aggregator only finalizes once
        listChunkResults().length == totalChunks;
        an early or replayed invocation is a no-op.
    end note
